    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92574" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοδάν-η</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοδανός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
